==English==

===Etymology===
The first words of the [[w:Athanasian Creed|Athanasian Creed]] are, in Latin, "''[[quicunque vult]] (salvus esse...)''", "whoever wants to (be saved...)".

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Athanasian]] [[wench]]|es}}

